1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,529
Could you see behind your head? Hey! How did it see me?

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,100
Let's zoom in!

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,300
Its eyes cover most of its head!

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,651
So it sees almost all around!

5
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:13,950
Can I sneak up on it? Nope!

6
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:16,228
It can even fly backwards!

7
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:20,672
Each eye has thousands of tiny eyes!

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,200
Hi, everybody!

9
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:27,493
That's a lot of Crumbs!

10
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:32,447
Six legs? In you go!

11
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:36,228
Can I hold the lens now? Not yet!

12
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,650
One, two, three, boo!

13
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,642
Can YOU see who's behind me?
